# Corridor Tokens

Move one cell right per action until the target. Moving beyond the corridor is illegal. Restart resets position only; first-clear rewards are idempotent. Pause blocks play input.

## Built-in modules

Tokens currency, settlement x2, home gift, level map, limited skins and optional +3 rewarded energy are explicit in starter.json. The saved reward never rerolls on retry. Reward cancellation grants nothing and returns to the same page.
